# Cloudflare Pages redirects (https://developers.cloudflare.com/pages/configuration/redirects/).
# Each section page is a directory with an index.html, served at a clean
# extensionless URL (e.g. quickstart/index.html -> /quickstart). A directory
# index is NOT served at the ".html" path, so requests that include the
# extension (e.g. /quickstart.html) would otherwise 404. Permanently redirect
# the ".html" form of every section to its canonical clean URL so old links,
# bookmarks, and typed-in extensions resolve.
#
# Format: <from> <to> <status>
/quickstart.html    /quickstart    301
/features.html      /features      301
/how-it-works.html  /how-it-works  301
/policies.html      /policies      301
/docs.html          /docs          301
/deploy.html        /deploy        301
/blog.html          /blog          301
